This level - stay near it until you have cleared out
at least some of the monsters.  In the mines it is
often necessary to descend, kill a few, climb back
to relative safety, recover, descend again in a
cycle.  Most other levels don't have as much open
space so the same theory applies just less so.

The next level - as soon as you see the down stairs,
go down then come back up.  Then if you fall down a
hole or trap door and you only drop one level
(common but not universal) you will know where the
up stairs are.


